    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="65">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Af">Af</ref> 65</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif mon sie on þa herðan to ðam swiðe wund, þæt he ne mæge bearn [gestrienen], gebete him ðæt mid LXXX scill.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If someone is wounded in the testicles so severely, that he may not conceive children, let him compensate him for that with 80 shillings.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">If a man is so badly wounded in the testicles that he cannot beget children, 80 shillings shall be paid to him as compensation for it.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif mon sy on ða herðan to þon swiðe wund, þæt he ne mage bearn gestrienan, gebete him ðæt mid LXXX scillingum.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
